'''Tutorial Cat''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that was introduced in [[Version 2.8.1 Update|Version 2.8.1]] and can be unlocked by the serial code とくい－ふくだ during the [[Tutorial Collaboration Event]]. He is now unavailable due to serial codes no longer existing.

{{Cat Info
|ID = 142
|rarity = EX
|name1 = Tutorial Cat
|name2 = Behind Tutorial
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Behind Tutorial''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
As a unit, Tutorial Cat is completely useless due to its very long cooldown and extremely low stats. It can neither be used as a meatshield, nor leave any impact as an attacker, and furthermore it doesn't have any combos. You can only use it for [[User Rank]] if you have lots of spare XP lying around.

{{Job|Classification = User Rank Dump}}

